            "created_at": "2025-08-23T23:58:39.236898+00:00",
            "notes": "#### \u2694\ufe0f IMPORTANT ITEMS\n\n\u2728[Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n- Absolutely amazing for Mercy's survivability. This is a must with [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), given its 15% [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and how much survivability it gives\n\n[Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) \n- This is a great item for movement, survivability and healing; You get a lot of [Move Speed](stat_move_speed), survivability from triggering [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) more often, and healing from the speed at which you can Guardian Angel and arrive to an ally to trigger [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9).\n\n[Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88)\n- Great since [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9)'s healing is distance based; It's best to Guardian Angel from the furthest distance possible.",
